                        <div data-lang-content="en" class="flex flex-col gap-5 text-[16px] text-[#090924] opacity-80 leading-relaxed">
                            <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. <span class="font-bold">For material changes</span> (such as changes to data collection practices), <span class="font-bold">we will notify you at least 30 days in advance via the App or by email (if available) and request your affirmative acceptance before the changes take effect.</span></p>
                            <p><span class="font-bold">For non-material changes</span> (such as clarifications), we will update the "Last updated" date at the top. Continued use of the App after such updates are published constitutes your acceptance of the changes.</p>
